🚗 What is Vehicle HAL (VHAL)?
    Vehicle HAL (VHAL) is the Hardware Abstraction Layer for vehicle systems in Android Automotive.
    👉 It acts as a bridge between Android (CarService) and vehicle hardware (ECUs via CAN/LIN/Ethernet).
    It exposes standardized vehicle properties so Android apps can read/write vehicle data without knowing hardware details.

