👉 What is Soong?
Soong is Android's primary build system. It reads declarative Android.bp module definitions, constructs the build graph and generates Ninja build rules, 
while Ninja executes the actual build commands. AOSP also has Kati/Make compatibility infrastructure during the transition away from Android.mk.

